OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Feasing this evening, although may
OL,7,Flinger until the small hours near the
OL,8,Fcoast. Clearing skies will lead to a
OL,9,Fchilly night, especially in the
OL,10,Fcountryside.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA mostly dry and bright day
OL,13,Fwith a mix of sunny spells and fair
OL,14,Fweather cloud. After a cool start,
OL,15,Ftemperatures climbing to around
OL,16,Faverage in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
