OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FRemaining largely dry with sunny
OL,7,Fspells on Sunday and Monday. Showers
OL,8,Fand possibly thunderstorms developing
OL,9,Fon Tuesday. Feeling warmer, especially
OL,10,Fin the sunshine.
